## Boundaries

- **Always:**
  - Use `defineBlueprint` and typed helper functions
  - Run `sanity blueprints plan` before deploying
  - Use references (`$.resources.<name>`) to link related resources
  - Keep blueprint files in version control

- **Never:**
  - Manually edit deployed resources outside of Blueprints (changes won't sync)
  - Hardcode sensitive values in a blueprint manifest file (use environment variables)
  - Manually edit the `.sanity/blueprint.config.json`; use `sanity blueprints config` instead
